data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt_2_3df2909d-1d95-4fb6-ab56-74be4209d896","delta":"Done. The spending breakdown now reads as blue throughout — category names, amounts, and the total in blue, percentages in a lighter blue, with soft blue row dividers.\n\nOne note: the heading, the card surface, and the divider line are built-in pieces that don't accept a color change, so those stayed as they were. If you'd like, I can rebuild the app with a fully blue frame around it."}

data: {"type":"text-end","id":"txt_2_3df2909d-1d95-4fb6-ab56-74be4209d896"}

